{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adaecs\/system"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An object that affects multiple entities in every frame."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"System","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"System is a fundomental part of ECS paradigm."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use systems to implement any behavior or logic that updates entities every frame,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as different types of objects or characters. For example, a physics simulation system calculates and applies the affect of gravity, forces, and collisions for all entities."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A complex game or experience may consist of many systems which need to be executed in a specific order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The dependencies property defines when the update method for each system is called each frame. Update order is defined between system types and not between individual system instances."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Like example, let’s create a movement system:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@PlainSystem","struct MovementSystem {","","    \/\/ Configure the query to world.","    \/\/ We want to reci